{
  "slug": "acp-find",
  "name": "Acp Find",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Semantic search and stack composition over the Virtuals Protocol ACP marketplace. Find on-chain agents and offerings without leaving Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **18 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `acp-find` (Use when the user wants to discover on-chain AI agents, offerings, or services on the Virtuals Protocol ACP…)\n- **Commands** (18): `agent-recent-jobs` (Recent on-chain job ledger for an ACP agent), `agent` (Show the full profile for an ACP agent by wallet address), `arena` (Inspect Degen Arena state — leaderboard, AI Council picks, and ACP overlap (via TheMetaBot)), `categories` (List the canonical ACP marketplace categories with offering counts), `compare` (Side-by-side comparison of 2-5 ACP agents), `cost` (Estimate the monthly cost of a stack of ACP offerings (one-shot + subscription)), `feed-address` (Look up the on-chain Chainlink reputation aggregator address for an ACP agent), `offering` (Deep-dive a single offering by (agentAddress, offeringName)), and 10 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `acp-find`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install acp-find@claude-community` from `oliver-pringle/acp-find-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
